# Requisições de exemplo para a extensão REST Client do VS Code.
# Rode a API (dotnet run) e clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@api = http://localhost:5080

### Saúde e índice de endpoints
GET {{api}}/api/health

###
GET {{api}}/api

### Cadastrar jogador (guarde o id e o token da resposta)
# @name register
POST {{api}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "MeuHeroi" }

###
@playerId = {{register.response.body.id}}
@token = {{register.response.body.token}}

### Iniciar partida
# @name run
POST {{api}}/api/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{token}}

{ "playerId": "{{playerId}}", "heroClass": "knight", "daily": false }

### Finalizar partida (o servidor recalcula a pontuação e valida)
POST {{api}}/api/runs/{{run.response.body.runId}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{token}}
X-Player-Id: {{playerId}}

{
  "heroClass": "knight", "floorsCleared": 0, "kills": 5, "bossesKilled": 0,
  "goldEarned": 20, "level": 2, "timeMs": 2000, "victory": false,
  "act": 1, "floor": 1, "seed": {{run.response.body.seed}}
}

### Ranking
GET {{api}}/api/leaderboard?top=10

### Desafio diário
GET {{api}}/api/daily

### Estatísticas globais
GET {{api}}/api/stats

### Perfil
GET {{api}}/api/players/{{playerId}}
X-Player-Token: {{token}}
